{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/neva-residences-tiger-group-jvc","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":465,"crm_id":"137","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Neva Residences","slug":"neva-residences-tiger-group-jvc","display_address":"Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC)","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2025","developer":"Tiger Group","price":763500,"display_price":"","lattitude":25.0686928,"longitude":55.2119881,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Neva Tower is an exclusive project from the developer Tiger Group, located in the dynamic and rapidly developing neighbourhood of JVC. The complex is a 16-storey building with an amazing architecture in a modern style. Clear straight lines, glass panels and high quality of finishing materials give uniqueness to the facades.&nbsp;</p><p>Delicate shades are used in the interiors, thanks to which each residence has a comfortable and cosy atmosphere. Each residence offers incredible views of the picturesque surroundings and cityscapes.</p><p>Neva Tower is in close proximity to Dubai's most significant locations. The Palm Jumeirah Peninsula and Mall of the Emirates are a 15-minute drive away. The famous Dubai Miracle Garden can be reached in 17 minutes, while Burj Khalifa and Dubai Mall are approximately 20 minutes away.</p><p>Neva Tower is an amazing residential complex that embodies modern lifestyle, luxury and maximum comfort. It is a truly dynamic place for a fulfilling life and a favourable investment option.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Neva_Residences_by_Tiger_Group_db6783d28a.jpg","hash":"Neva_Residences_by_Tiger_Group_db6783d28a","name":"Neva Residences by Tiger Group"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Neva_Resid